1
00:01:36,090 --> 00:01:40,030
[River of No Return]

2
00:01:40,050 --> 00:01:42,850
[Episode 4: Regicide]

3
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:44,690
You weren't sent by Zhu Buhua.

4
00:01:51,240 --> 00:01:53,170
What kind of prescription is this?

5
00:01:54,740 --> 00:01:58,240
Veratrum, raw turtle shell,
and whole crickets?

6
00:01:58,700 --> 00:02:00,160
Its effects can be potent.

7
00:02:00,320 --> 00:02:01,720
It can not only save lives

8
00:02:01,870 --> 00:02:03,400
but also turn yang into yin,

9
00:02:04,040 --> 00:02:05,730
killing people without a trace.

10
00:02:05,730 --> 00:02:06,790
You know medicine?

11
00:02:06,820 --> 00:02:08,020
I know people better.

12
00:02:08,449 --> 00:02:08,919
Speak.

13
00:02:10,100 --> 00:02:11,760
Who is this prescription for?

14
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:13,540
What illness does he have?

15
00:02:17,480 --> 00:02:18,040
Eunuch,

16
00:02:18,420 --> 00:02:21,010
Yuan Zhongda submitted a secret report
on Beijing to the Crown Prince.

17
00:02:21,010 --> 00:02:23,470
They are now playing go
behind closed doors.

18
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:58,350
Your Highness.

19
00:03:01,360 --> 00:03:05,190
[Hulan Hushiwen]

20
00:03:22,310 --> 00:03:23,130
Back then,

21
00:03:23,310 --> 00:03:24,690
Emperor Taizong

22
00:03:25,070 --> 00:03:27,160
ordered me to find someone.

23
00:03:27,750 --> 00:03:29,480
I accidentally learned about

24
00:03:29,660 --> 00:03:32,079
the secret passage
in the Imperial City in Jinling,

25
00:03:32,079 --> 00:03:34,290
so I immediately went
to the northern desert region

26
00:03:34,290 --> 00:03:36,290
to report it to Emperor Taizong.

27
00:03:58,360 --> 00:04:00,140
This is the secret passage

28
00:04:00,570 --> 00:04:02,030
inside the Imperial City.

29
00:04:03,920 --> 00:04:05,320
Have you got a good look?

30
00:04:08,700 --> 00:04:09,960
Have you memorized it?

31
00:04:11,070 --> 00:04:11,920
Yes, I have.

32
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:16,450
Lord Yuan!

33
00:04:32,370 --> 00:04:33,230
Your Highness.

34
00:04:44,070 --> 00:04:45,010
Lord Yuan,

35
00:04:45,780 --> 00:04:46,960
have some pastries.

36
00:05:10,670 --> 00:05:14,200
You're the only one who knows
the secret passage out of the palace.

37
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:15,780
My life now rests

38
00:05:18,460 --> 00:05:19,930
in your hands.

39
00:05:29,570 --> 00:05:30,720
If you

40
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:36,200
fall into Zhu Buhua's hands,

41
00:05:37,460 --> 00:05:39,130
you'll wish you were dead.

42
00:05:39,990 --> 00:05:40,880
If I...

43
00:05:44,170 --> 00:05:46,080
grant you death now,

44
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:48,570
at least

45
00:05:49,950 --> 00:05:51,930
your honor will remain intact.

46
00:05:54,200 --> 00:05:55,659
Thank you, Your Highness.

47
00:05:58,430 --> 00:06:00,690
Thank you for your grace, Your Highness.

48
00:06:10,840 --> 00:06:11,810
Thank you, sir.

49
00:06:27,950 --> 00:06:30,080
Do you happen to have one of those...

50
00:06:30,510 --> 00:06:34,200
something handy you could use?

51
00:06:39,940 --> 00:06:44,970
♪ The boat fades into the night ♪

52
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:50,450
♪ Oars carry the moonlight westward ♪

53
00:06:51,409 --> 00:06:56,450
♪ Lights flicker along the shore ♪

54
00:06:56,470 --> 00:07:01,700
♪ Why do they dim,
and for whom do they glow? ♪

55
00:07:05,090 --> 00:07:10,700
♪ The road ahead churns without end ♪

56
00:07:11,050 --> 00:07:19,140
♪ Let the waves engulf me,
and I won't look back ♪

57
00:07:31,650 --> 00:07:34,640
♪ I've seen the world's sorrow and joy ♪

58
00:07:34,670 --> 00:07:37,360
♪ I seek a world of peace and prosperity ♪

59
00:07:37,400 --> 00:07:43,250
♪ Only at journey's end
will I understand ♪

60
00:07:39,020 --> 00:07:40,370
This is a plaything

61
00:07:42,130 --> 00:07:43,930
presented to me by Zheng Sanbao.

62
00:07:50,460 --> 00:07:52,760
Zheng Sanbao is really something.

63
00:07:52,990 --> 00:07:54,980
He really knows how to be an official.

64
00:07:54,980 --> 00:07:55,810
How does he

65
00:07:56,580 --> 00:07:59,430
always manage to make you so happy?

66
00:08:01,540 --> 00:08:02,870
I could never match him.

67
00:08:49,770 --> 00:08:50,640
Sir,

68
00:08:51,950 --> 00:08:53,080
I have no one

69
00:08:54,450 --> 00:08:56,410
left in Jinling whom I can trust.

70
00:09:07,920 --> 00:09:10,570
[The Battle of Hulan Hushiwen,
the 13th year of Yongle reign]

71
00:09:25,930 --> 00:09:29,040
[Zhu Di, Emperor Taizong]

72
00:09:47,150 --> 00:09:49,900
[Young Zhu Zhanji]

73
00:10:01,860 --> 00:10:04,170
If you turn back to save them,

74
00:10:04,450 --> 00:10:06,180
you are unworthy of the throne.

75
00:10:08,550 --> 00:10:11,050
But if you forget them in the future,

76
00:10:11,580 --> 00:10:13,990
you are not fit to be a Zhu.

77
00:10:14,510 --> 00:10:16,800
Those who died for me in the past,

78
00:10:17,500 --> 00:10:18,720
I couldn't save.

79
00:10:20,170 --> 00:10:22,360
And those who die for me now,

80
00:10:22,810 --> 00:10:24,120
I will never forget.

81
00:10:25,410 --> 00:10:27,030
-I'll speak! I'll speak!
-Speak!

82
00:10:27,030 --> 00:10:28,000
-I'll speak!
-Speak!

83
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:28,930
Speak right now!

84
00:10:28,960 --> 00:10:29,620
Let go of me!

85
00:10:30,770 --> 00:10:31,480
Speak.

86
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:35,030
It's for Zhu Buhua.

87
00:10:35,460 --> 00:10:37,120
I prescribed it for Zhu Buhua.

88
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:38,410
Zhu Buhua is not sick.

89
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:39,720
My Lord,

90
00:10:40,170 --> 00:10:41,070
since you know medicine,

91
00:10:41,070 --> 00:10:42,470
you should be able to tell

92
00:10:42,670 --> 00:10:44,330
that I prescribed him poison.

93
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,600
I want to kill him.

94
00:10:46,200 --> 00:10:46,960
What?

95
00:10:50,450 --> 00:10:51,720
I know Eunuch Zhu's

96
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:53,200
favorite food

97
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:55,410
is Fan's Roast Goose
beyond Xuanjin Bridge.

98
00:10:55,410 --> 00:10:56,410
The owner of Fan's

99
00:10:56,820 --> 00:10:59,280
makes a small pot of fresh marinade
every day

100
00:10:59,740 --> 00:11:01,480
just to cook goose meat for him.

101
00:11:02,450 --> 00:11:03,120
So...

102
00:11:04,220 --> 00:11:06,220
I bribed the shop assistant a little

103
00:11:06,890 --> 00:11:09,150
and added an ingredient to the marinade,

104
00:11:09,860 --> 00:11:10,990
Chatou bream liver.

105
00:11:11,080 --> 00:11:11,770
What liver?

106
00:11:12,530 --> 00:11:13,430
Don't interrupt.

107
00:11:13,430 --> 00:11:14,290
Chatou bream.

108
00:11:14,530 --> 00:11:16,200
Meng Haoran ate Chatou bream

109
00:11:16,740 --> 00:11:18,340
and died of a back carbuncle.

110
00:11:19,050 --> 00:11:20,000
Died?

111
00:11:20,240 --> 00:11:21,670
Who died? Meng what?

112
00:11:21,670 --> 00:11:23,400
Don't interrupt. Meng Haoran.

113
00:11:24,470 --> 00:11:27,330
Don't tell me
you don't even know who Meng Haoran is.

114
00:11:28,860 --> 00:11:29,820
Of course I know.

115
00:11:30,470 --> 00:11:31,830
Don't look at me like that.

116
00:11:31,830 --> 00:11:33,960
I'll go to his house to verify it later.

117
00:11:34,170 --> 00:11:34,840
Go on.

118
00:11:38,740 --> 00:11:40,120
In a few days at most,

119
00:11:41,570 --> 00:11:43,960
Zhu Buhua will die of a carbuncle.

120
00:11:45,480 --> 00:11:46,670
Why do you want to kill him?

121
00:11:46,670 --> 00:11:48,170
He killed my close friend.

122
00:11:48,720 --> 00:11:50,380
I want him to pay with his life!

123
00:12:25,620 --> 00:12:26,840
Where are my people?

124
00:12:27,050 --> 00:12:28,450
Where else could they be?

125
00:12:28,770 --> 00:12:29,970
Rebellious traitors

126
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:31,600
are naturally locked in prison
awaiting trial.

127
00:12:31,600 --> 00:12:32,550
Traitors?

128
00:12:39,170 --> 00:12:40,100
Traitors?

129
00:12:41,070 --> 00:12:41,860
If we are traitors,

130
00:12:41,860 --> 00:12:43,320
then what are you, Eunuch?

131
00:12:45,070 --> 00:12:46,690
A mad dog who bit its master?

132
00:12:52,580 --> 00:12:55,040
Eunuch Zhu,
you've been delaying your move.

133
00:12:56,200 --> 00:12:57,410
Are you backing out?

134
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:01,080
If you hadn't failed repeatedly,

135
00:13:01,650 --> 00:13:03,910
I wouldn't have had to clean up your mess.

136
00:13:04,620 --> 00:13:06,450
That's not fair, Eunuch Zhu.

137
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:08,430
What the Iron Alliance
promised your master

138
00:13:08,430 --> 00:13:10,910
was just to load the Huliu explosive
onto the ship.

139
00:13:10,910 --> 00:13:13,880
You were the one who had Guo Zhimin
bring the explosives out of the palace.

140
00:13:13,880 --> 00:13:16,480
Technically,
your crime is greater than ours.

141
00:13:17,250 --> 00:13:19,510
We have helped you silence Guo Zhimin.

142
00:13:20,100 --> 00:13:21,830
What are you still waiting for?

143
00:13:22,860 --> 00:13:26,320
Now the whole world knows the Crown Prince
has entered the Imperial City.

144
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:27,770
If I make a move now,

145
00:13:28,050 --> 00:13:29,850
wouldn't it be telling the world

146
00:13:30,340 --> 00:13:33,940
that I, Zhu Buhua, am a traitor
who killed his emperor and father?

147
00:13:34,410 --> 00:13:36,470
You've been a traitor for a long time.

148
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:50,650
Since ancient times,

149
00:13:52,050 --> 00:13:53,600
those who play both sides

150
00:13:54,220 --> 00:13:56,570
never end up well.

151
00:13:57,530 --> 00:13:59,360
I'm just leaving myself

152
00:13:59,530 --> 00:14:01,120
a way out.

153
00:14:20,220 --> 00:14:21,120
Eunuch Zhu,

154
00:14:21,930 --> 00:14:23,730
there's no need to overthink it.

155
00:14:27,450 --> 00:14:29,410
Just make it look like a young eunuch
trying to win favor

156
00:14:29,410 --> 00:14:31,940
but failing that,
planning to commit murder.

157
00:14:34,500 --> 00:14:35,320
Except for me,

158
00:14:38,410 --> 00:14:40,870
no one will know
you killed the Crown Prince.

159
00:14:41,780 --> 00:14:42,930
When was your

160
00:14:42,980 --> 00:14:44,800
last follow-up with Eunuch Zhu?

161
00:14:45,700 --> 00:14:46,730
Once at noon yesterday,

162
00:14:46,730 --> 00:14:47,950
and once at midnight.

163
00:14:49,150 --> 00:14:50,480
Yesterday at noon?

164
00:14:51,030 --> 00:14:54,380
Zhu Buhua should have been at Dongshuiguan Wharf
to receive the imperial procession.

165
00:14:54,380 --> 00:14:56,930
Why did he have to schedule
the follow-up at that time?

166
00:14:56,930 --> 00:14:59,170
Did he deliberately skip it?

167
00:15:00,660 --> 00:15:02,120
Wait. Where are you going?

168
00:15:02,580 --> 00:15:03,840
Zhu Buhua is a suspect.

169
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:05,970
I must report this to the Crown Prince!

170
00:15:32,290 --> 00:15:33,490
Great-grandfather,

171
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:35,520
Great-grandmother.

172
00:15:39,390 --> 00:15:42,430
[Spirit Tablet of Empress Xiao Ci Gao
of the Great Ming]

173
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:44,930
Grandfather,

174
00:15:46,000 --> 00:15:46,960
Grandmother.

175
00:15:49,810 --> 00:15:50,960
I am now

176
00:15:52,860 --> 00:15:54,860
trapped in this secondary capital.

177
00:15:55,830 --> 00:15:56,900
But I

178
00:15:59,250 --> 00:16:01,230
will never fail the Ming Empire.

179
00:16:02,600 --> 00:16:05,460
Grandfather,
I will always remember the teachings

180
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:09,170
you have given me since childhood.

181
00:16:34,520 --> 00:16:36,510
If I ever forget them,

182
00:16:37,720 --> 00:16:38,600
I won't deserve

183
00:16:41,390 --> 00:16:43,120
to be a member of the Zhu family.

184
00:17:22,010 --> 00:17:22,599
Loose!

185
00:18:11,540 --> 00:18:12,480
Eunuch Zhu!

186
00:18:13,580 --> 00:18:15,840
Come and see your precious Crown Prince.

187
00:18:24,350 --> 00:18:26,060
I didn't want this.

188
00:18:27,630 --> 00:18:29,290
Only if you die, Crown Prince,

189
00:18:30,740 --> 00:18:32,930
can I live.

190
00:18:53,610 --> 00:18:55,940
Is that what your Crown Prince looks like?

191
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:05,560
Little Sixi?

192
00:19:17,720 --> 00:19:18,850
Zhu Buhua.

193
00:19:22,170 --> 00:19:22,960
Who is it?

194
00:19:23,650 --> 00:19:24,480
Who's there?

195
00:19:24,870 --> 00:19:25,800
Come out!

196
00:19:26,190 --> 00:19:27,610
You! You!

197
00:19:27,910 --> 00:19:29,720
Come out! Come out!

198
00:19:32,760 --> 00:19:33,850
Zhu Buhua.

199
00:19:34,670 --> 00:19:36,600
You are disloyal and unrighteous.

200
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:38,890
Grandfather misjudged you!

201
00:19:39,480 --> 00:19:41,450
Stop playing tricks!

202
00:19:41,910 --> 00:19:43,090
Who are you?

203
00:19:45,240 --> 00:19:46,040
Who are you?

204
00:19:46,460 --> 00:19:47,450
Who is it?

205
00:19:47,830 --> 00:19:48,480
Who is it?

206
00:20:03,630 --> 00:20:04,280
Zhu Wu!

207
00:20:05,020 --> 00:20:05,720
Go after him!

208
00:20:05,720 --> 00:20:06,240
Yes!

209
00:20:08,800 --> 00:20:09,610
Hurry up!

210
00:20:45,280 --> 00:20:46,280
Check over there!

211
00:21:15,040 --> 00:21:15,650
Eunuch!

212
00:21:16,760 --> 00:21:18,160
Lord Yuan's body is here.

213
00:23:01,350 --> 00:23:03,760
Little Sixi, the attendant
of the Crown Prince's bedchamber...

214
00:23:03,760 --> 00:23:05,360
Poisoned the Prince's meal.

215
00:23:05,560 --> 00:23:07,560
When discovered by His Highness...

216
00:23:07,610 --> 00:23:09,910
He suddenly flew into a rage
and attempted to kill His Highness.

217
00:23:09,910 --> 00:23:11,970
The Crown Prince was murdered by him!

218
00:23:13,090 --> 00:23:14,220
Imperial Guards!

219
00:23:14,450 --> 00:23:15,650
Deploy all forces!

220
00:23:16,480 --> 00:23:17,930
Search every palace!

221
00:23:18,150 --> 00:23:18,800
Yes!

222
00:23:39,820 --> 00:23:40,520
Report!

223
00:23:43,650 --> 00:23:44,220
Eunuch,

224
00:23:44,410 --> 00:23:45,760
we've searched the area
around Fengxian Hall, Dashan Hall,

225
00:23:45,760 --> 00:23:46,450
and Rouyi Hall.

226
00:23:46,450 --> 00:23:47,500
No sign of the fugitive.

227
00:23:47,500 --> 00:23:48,330
Report!

228
00:23:49,500 --> 00:23:50,000
Eunuch,

229
00:23:50,090 --> 00:23:51,170
we've searched the area
around Chunhe Palace

230
00:23:51,170 --> 00:23:51,960
and Wenhua Hall.

231
00:23:51,960 --> 00:23:53,150
No sign of the fugitive.

232
00:23:53,150 --> 00:23:53,800
Report!

233
00:23:54,040 --> 00:23:54,650
Eunuch,

234
00:23:54,720 --> 00:23:55,850
we've searched all three main halls.

235
00:23:55,850 --> 00:23:56,980
No sign of the fugitive.

236
00:23:56,980 --> 00:23:57,720
Keep searching.

237
00:23:57,720 --> 00:23:58,380
-Yes!
-Yes!

238
00:24:03,740 --> 00:24:04,400
Godfather.

239
00:25:23,320 --> 00:25:24,620
Godfather, it's here!

240
00:25:39,870 --> 00:25:40,700
Have you searched it?

241
00:25:40,700 --> 00:25:41,330
Not yet.

242
00:25:41,520 --> 00:25:42,700
What are you waiting for?

243
00:25:42,700 --> 00:25:43,280
Yes.

244
00:25:49,110 --> 00:25:49,710
You three,

245
00:25:49,760 --> 00:25:50,360
follow me!

246
00:25:50,450 --> 00:25:51,170
-Yes!
-Yes!

247
00:28:48,980 --> 00:28:50,130
Take 10 paces

248
00:28:51,110 --> 00:28:53,040
down to the drainage channel.

249
00:29:07,580 --> 00:29:08,780
After 50 paces,

250
00:29:10,100 --> 00:29:12,690
exit the channel and turn right.

251
00:29:18,610 --> 00:29:20,670
Go to the end

252
00:29:37,100 --> 00:29:38,630
and break through the wall.

253
00:30:46,130 --> 00:30:46,830
You two,

254
00:30:47,070 --> 00:30:47,730
go this way!

255
00:30:48,040 --> 00:30:49,020
You, follow me.

256
00:32:18,830 --> 00:32:19,490
Godfather!

257
00:32:19,700 --> 00:32:20,360
Godfather!

258
00:32:25,890 --> 00:32:27,310
This is the Crown Prince's jade pendant.

259
00:32:27,310 --> 00:32:28,070
And this.

260
00:32:32,090 --> 00:32:34,220
He wouldn't take these things with him

261
00:32:34,260 --> 00:32:36,320
if he were trying to escape, would he?

262
00:32:37,350 --> 00:32:39,150
An emperor's ceremonial crown?

263
00:32:40,590 --> 00:32:42,790
This is Zhu Yunwen's ceremonial crown.

264
00:32:43,450 --> 00:32:45,130
Zhu Yunwen?

265
00:32:47,220 --> 00:32:48,420
The Emperor Jianwen?

266
00:32:48,720 --> 00:32:50,000
So this is how Zhu Yunwen

267
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:51,690
escaped back then.

268
00:32:52,980 --> 00:32:56,040
That's why the Crown Prince
wanted to see Yuan Zhongda.

269
00:32:56,170 --> 00:32:58,830
From the 5th to the 21st year
of the Yongle reign,

270
00:32:59,040 --> 00:33:00,890
Yuan Zhongda spent 16 years

271
00:33:00,910 --> 00:33:03,970
searching for Zhu Yunwen
on behalf of Emperor Taizong.

272
00:33:04,060 --> 00:33:05,480
That old fox

273
00:33:06,410 --> 00:33:09,610
must have revealed this secret passage
to the Crown Prince

274
00:33:09,610 --> 00:33:10,980
while they were playing go today.

275
00:33:10,980 --> 00:33:11,720
From the very beginning,

276
00:33:11,720 --> 00:33:14,330
the only person he really wanted to see
was Yuan Zhongda.

277
00:33:14,330 --> 00:33:15,790
He'd been wary of you

278
00:33:15,820 --> 00:33:17,680
ever since he entered the palace.

279
00:33:23,720 --> 00:33:25,040
Where does this secret passage lead?

280
00:33:25,040 --> 00:33:26,450
It should lead to the Qinhuai River.

281
00:33:26,450 --> 00:33:28,130
All the palace drainage channels

282
00:33:28,130 --> 00:33:29,790
empty into the Qinhuai River.

283
00:33:30,640 --> 00:33:33,480
If the Crown Prince
really makes it into the Qinhuai River,

284
00:33:33,480 --> 00:33:35,040
no one will ever find him.

285
00:33:36,630 --> 00:33:37,370
Envoy,

286
00:33:37,760 --> 00:33:38,820
you can go back now.

287
00:33:39,540 --> 00:33:40,840
Follow me up the city wall!

288
00:33:40,840 --> 00:33:41,540
Yes!

289
00:34:59,240 --> 00:34:59,900
Over there!

290
00:34:59,940 --> 00:35:00,750
Over there!

291
00:35:09,720 --> 00:35:10,340
Move!

292
00:35:25,230 --> 00:35:26,090
Draw your bows!

293
00:35:32,960 --> 00:35:33,480
Loose!

294
00:35:57,310 --> 00:35:58,080
One.

295
00:36:00,020 --> 00:36:00,640
Two.

296
00:36:05,230 --> 00:36:06,210
Three.

297
00:36:10,930 --> 00:36:11,840
Four.

298
00:37:44,750 --> 00:37:48,900
[Zhu Gaoxi, Prince Han]

299
00:38:21,990 --> 00:38:25,260
A strange thing happened
in my hometown last year.

300
00:38:25,980 --> 00:38:29,560
An old woman had been bedridden
with a chronic illness for years.

301
00:38:29,560 --> 00:38:32,230
A traveling physician gave her

302
00:38:32,600 --> 00:38:35,260
a prescription
for Yang-restoring Decoction.

303
00:38:35,660 --> 00:38:38,080
After taking it,
her qi and blood recovered,

304
00:38:38,080 --> 00:38:39,810
and she was able to
move about freely again.

305
00:38:39,810 --> 00:38:41,670
It was truly a miraculous remedy.

306
00:38:43,660 --> 00:38:45,120
Do you think my sister-in-law

307
00:38:45,120 --> 00:38:46,580
will fall for this?

308
00:38:46,800 --> 00:38:50,660
[Lord Song, Vice Minister of Rites]

309
00:38:47,290 --> 00:38:48,990
Whether she believes it is up to her.

310
00:38:48,990 --> 00:38:50,750
But she won't have much choice.

311
00:38:52,160 --> 00:38:53,600
At a time like this,

312
00:38:54,330 --> 00:38:57,190
you are pulling out all the stops.

313
00:38:57,600 --> 00:38:59,330
Do you really think it'll work?

314
00:38:59,950 --> 00:39:02,640
It may not work for me,

315
00:39:03,310 --> 00:39:05,730
but for Your Highness, Prince Han...

316
00:39:05,730 --> 00:39:06,960
Are you saying

317
00:39:07,710 --> 00:39:10,500
you want to give it to me
as a token of your affection?

318
00:39:10,500 --> 00:39:11,370
Precisely.

319
00:39:11,390 --> 00:39:12,240
Why?

320
00:39:13,040 --> 00:39:16,500
Giving it to you is giving it to myself.

321
00:39:19,750 --> 00:39:22,480
Have you been
carrying this prescription on you?

322
00:39:47,340 --> 00:39:47,970
You...

323
00:39:48,520 --> 00:39:50,060
Anyway, Eunuch Zhu has ordered

324
00:39:50,060 --> 00:39:51,100
that no one may enter or leave

325
00:39:51,100 --> 00:39:52,520
without
his personal written authorization!

326
00:39:52,520 --> 00:39:53,450
Look carefully.

327
00:39:53,680 --> 00:39:55,450
This is Lord Zheng He's token.

328
00:39:55,500 --> 00:39:56,770
I must go in today!

329
00:39:57,140 --> 00:39:58,250
I must see Eunuch Zhu!

330
00:39:58,250 --> 00:39:58,810
Stop him!

331
00:39:58,840 --> 00:39:59,850
What are you doing?

332
00:39:59,850 --> 00:40:00,350
You...

333
00:40:00,950 --> 00:40:01,890
Don't move! Behave yourself.

334
00:40:01,890 --> 00:40:05,480
Let go! Let go! Let go!

335
00:40:09,040 --> 00:40:11,170
That treacherous bastard, Zhu Buhua.

336
00:40:11,480 --> 00:40:13,160
He's probably already made his move.

337
00:40:13,160 --> 00:40:14,890
That Crown Prince of yours

338
00:40:14,910 --> 00:40:16,740
is an old mule.

339
00:40:17,170 --> 00:40:18,620
I told him not to enter the palace,

340
00:40:18,620 --> 00:40:19,950
but he wouldn't listen.

341
00:40:20,160 --> 00:40:20,930
Now look.

342
00:40:21,000 --> 00:40:21,830
He can't get out.

343
00:40:21,830 --> 00:40:23,290
Stop wasting my time
with all this nonsense.

344
00:40:23,290 --> 00:40:24,220
Our top priority

345
00:40:24,310 --> 00:40:26,170
is figuring out how to get inside.

346
00:40:26,410 --> 00:40:27,680
As things stand,

347
00:40:28,830 --> 00:40:30,890
we have no choice but to take a gamble.

348
00:40:31,390 --> 00:40:32,320
Little Xingren,

349
00:40:32,460 --> 00:40:34,000
head southeast.

350
00:40:34,390 --> 00:40:36,390
Dr. Su and I will handle things here.

351
00:40:36,820 --> 00:40:37,990
Whether we succeed or not,

352
00:40:37,990 --> 00:40:40,290
we'll meet at the 5th house
in the middle lane

353
00:40:40,290 --> 00:40:43,020
of Tangfanglang,
northwest of Zhenhuai Bridge.

354
00:40:55,660 --> 00:40:56,720
Which house again?

355
00:40:57,450 --> 00:40:58,250
The 5th house.

356
00:40:58,690 --> 00:40:59,140
Okay.

357
00:40:59,200 --> 00:41:00,130
Useless fool.

358
00:41:00,330 --> 00:41:00,930
Go now!

359
00:41:05,040 --> 00:41:06,250
So where are we going?

360
00:41:06,710 --> 00:41:07,730
Nowhere.

361
00:41:08,530 --> 00:41:10,450
So you sent him away on purpose?

362
00:41:13,890 --> 00:41:14,750
Smart.

363
00:41:17,980 --> 00:41:19,680
Now it's just you and me.

364
00:41:20,540 --> 00:41:22,680
No need to beat around the bush, right?

365
00:41:23,330 --> 00:41:24,850
Are you trying to save the Crown Prince

366
00:41:24,850 --> 00:41:25,770
or kill him?

367
00:41:25,820 --> 00:41:26,360
Speak!

368
00:41:28,320 --> 00:41:30,410
I've never intended
to kill the Crown Prince!

369
00:41:30,410 --> 00:41:31,810
I'm here to kill Zhu Buhua,

370
00:41:31,810 --> 00:41:33,270
that treacherous eunuch!

371
00:41:46,830 --> 00:41:48,160
Search along the river!

372
00:41:48,200 --> 00:41:49,100
I want him,

373
00:41:49,310 --> 00:41:50,250
alive or dead!

374
00:42:07,140 --> 00:42:08,770
What are you doing? Let me go!

375
00:42:09,390 --> 00:42:10,530
Why should I listen to you?

376
00:42:10,530 --> 00:42:11,810
You think you can just put your arms
around me whenever you want,

377
00:42:11,810 --> 00:42:12,620
then let go whenever you please?

378
00:42:12,620 --> 00:42:14,020
Well, I'm not letting go.

379
00:42:15,410 --> 00:42:16,430
I won't let go!

380
00:42:18,370 --> 00:42:18,950
You...

381
00:42:19,830 --> 00:42:20,460
Let go!

382
00:42:24,290 --> 00:42:25,420
Good-for-Nothing,

383
00:42:25,800 --> 00:42:26,310
don't forget

384
00:42:26,310 --> 00:42:27,890
why you brought me here.

385
00:42:34,390 --> 00:42:35,250
Then why

386
00:42:36,000 --> 00:42:36,730
are you here?

387
00:42:48,290 --> 00:42:49,090
Nothing here!

388
00:42:51,080 --> 00:42:51,880
Nothing here!

389
00:43:01,770 --> 00:43:02,430
Godfather!

390
00:43:02,680 --> 00:43:03,340
Godfather!

391
00:43:03,540 --> 00:43:04,200
Godfather!

392
00:43:04,830 --> 00:43:07,080
We've arranged for people
to search the river and the banks.

393
00:43:07,080 --> 00:43:08,340
Did you find anything?

394
00:43:09,040 --> 00:43:09,850
Not yet.
